              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• <strong>&lt;h1&gt;–&lt;h6&gt;</strong> define hierarchy</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• <strong>&lt;p&gt;</strong> creates a paragraph block</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\">• Best practice: use one <strong>&lt;h1&gt;</strong> per page</p>",
